{"version":1,"key":"card:641","content":{"id":641,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6297f936-8a62-4e24-a593-4873debb6bd1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么是期货（Futures）？简单可以理解为一份未来的买卖合同。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"95fea6b6-95a2-45fe-a42f-3ea91b187ec4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设存在这么两名角色，农民伯伯和面板店老板。农民伯伯种了很多的小麦，面板店老板需要小麦制作面包，二者存在交易关系，但是它们都有各自的担忧："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"9a621ebb-af99-4524-8177-287091b987ae","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0c42616b-1283-4bca-8c3f-84b2e10e43c8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"08c691b7-cb7a-415e-b606-1b4d7d412c5b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"农民伯伯担心 3 个月后收成是小麦价格大跌，血本无归"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6ebe8066-d84c-4b1c-ad91-a6823dcfcf09","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a2688997-ae1a-4b46-899f-f97ea0e07b9e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"面包店老板担心 3 个月后小麦价格大涨，成本增加"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4abd3c61-6cf1-4268-8903-f9d5ace545cf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"于是他们一拍即合，制定一个合同，在 3 个月后以约定好的价格，买卖约定好数量和质量的小麦，通过这份合同，农民伯伯锁定了利润，面包店老板锁定了成本，这份合同就是"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"期货合同"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（Futures Contract），简称"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"期货"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"34ffdb66-1fc8-477d-9bd0-89cd812fc65f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述也阐述了期货最原始也是最核心的作用："},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"规避价格波动的风险"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（套期保值）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"14dfb63d-ba2f-4699-b9db-bab4eb1ceb5c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面是期货更正式的定义："}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"54414b52-bdad-4f78-b779-4910a3569a4b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"82ca051a-8c66-44fe-86a6-8d85b60428da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"期货（Futures），是一种标准化的、可在期货交易所公开交易的法律合同。该合同约定了交易双方在未来的特定日期，以预先确定的价格，买入或卖出特定数量和质量的"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"标的物"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9655f832-0737-4198-912b-a5366a59dc0b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里的标的物可以是："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f756aec0-73cf-41f2-9a5b-c38b16a3c989","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5a7ff44a-8e86-4dc5-9097-0d34f6ac7040","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2168584d-138d-4059-a8f8-39295bd05451","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实体商品：黄金、石油、大豆、棉花"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"373c4cc8-1b26-4921-8091-1efa0d0d5e53","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5c5a830e-037e-4888-9e64-5d970e6ce887","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"金融资产：股指（如标普 500）、国债、外汇"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6e3eab9b-9da0-43f2-a47f-b04e58b267c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于实体商品我们能理解，交付的就是具体的实体商品，但是对于金融资产，我们交付的是什么，总不能交付指数吧（这个也没法交付），其实对于金融资产我们交付的是钱。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"10947769-fe70-4bff-b938-7d8b6f4ae88d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"举一个例子，假设你这个时候对于中国股市特别看好，认为沪深 300 指数会有一波上涨，假设当前点位是 4000 点，你购买了一份期货合约，合约规定 300元/点（每波动一个点，合约价值就变动 300 元），保证金比例是 12%，如果你买下这份合约，这份合约的价值是 300 × 4000 = 120w，但是不需要真的给 120w，只需要缴纳保证金 120w × 0.12 = 14.4w（可见期货存在很大的杠杆），如果合约到期后，沪深 300 指数涨到了 4100，那么你就赚了 (4100 - 4000) × 300 = 3w，利润里是 3w / 14.4w = 20.8%，反过来如果指数跌到了 3900，你就亏了 3w，亏损率也达到了 20.8%，可见高杠杆能带来高收益，但是同时也可能带来高损失。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8f0fc777-5504-442b-a2c5-2c2a4990fb52","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的例子是作为个人"},{"type":"styled-text","color":"blue","tauContract":"d18485913856addbefa2ced1511da60261ef67fcb40faff6190f86232aa01390","collabId":"582a287a-f724-49d6-ba45-c6bc1bb39e57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"投机者"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"的视角，在看几个"},{"type":"styled-text","color":"blue","tauContract":"d18485913856addbefa2ced1511da60261ef67fcb40faff6190f86232aa01390","collabId":"63367750-1250-4e27-bb50-273ca2f9a8e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"套期保利者"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"的视角："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"77c3bebd-a6b8-4a15-9e50-ab7b6f4dd7c4","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f673b838-0885-4fbf-ae8a-e492c7428e3d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"872805f4-515c-4813-810e-11afd046b77d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候你买的股票本身是家好公司，但是如果整个股市行情不好（比如经济危机，黑天鹅事件），你的股票也会大跌，这种系统性风险是无法通过分散投资来消除的。假设你判断未来股市会有剧烈回调，因为长期来看非常的有潜力，你不想卖出这些优质资产，这个时候就可以借助期货市场来进行对冲"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4851515f-45c4-4d02-a4b5-f35ddc33292e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设沪深 300 指数是 4000 点，合约乘数是 300，一份价值是 120w，假设你有 10 亿资产需要对冲，那么就需要卖出 10亿/120万 = 833 手期货合约，两个月后，股市果然下跌了 10%，从 4000 点跌到了 3600 点，股票亏损 1 个亿，而在期货市场，通过 3600 点买入期货平仓，总盈利 (4000 - 3600) × 300 × 833 = 1亿，股票的亏损和期货市场的盈利抵消，度过了此次股市剧烈回调"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f2916818-62c2-48dd-b96e-3bf7353d28e1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"52bf3dcf-0a9d-42d4-8075-bb04ee1e2b44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"某家航空公司预测未来燃油价格会上涨，对于航空公司来说，燃油成本占据总成本的 20%-30%，价格剧烈波动对利润影响很大，如果真的价格上涨，可能导致巨额亏损，这个时候就可以使用原油期货合约进行对冲"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"27db7db9-cf28-4b2a-9498-2e9ca19c4d13","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设航空公司未来 6 个月会消耗 100 万桶油，买了 100 万份原油期货合约，现在每桶油的价格是 80 美元/桶，6 个月后原油价格果然暴涨，涨到了 105 美元/桶，那么实际的采购成本增加了 25 × 100万 = 2500万，这时将期货合约卖出，可以赚到 25 × 100万 = 2500万，多付的采购成本和从期货市场赚到的钱对冲，航空公司将成本锁定在了最初的 80 美元/桶"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8e2162ce-c156-4f89-b6f8-cea6961249e8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"13c19cf1-e24e-466e-8cc6-ab1029bc08de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设你是一位募集到大量资金的经理，手上握有大笔现金，你认为未来将会迎来一波牛市，想要购入大量股票，但是如果短时间内把大量现金全部买成股票，会对市场造成冲击，抬高买入股票的建仓成本，但是如果缓慢建仓，就可能会错过这盘牛市（这就是所谓的踏空），影响基金业绩，这个时候就可以通过期货市场对冲，锁定当前的建仓成本"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d8dc51d2-e8b8-4339-a69d-04303840f1ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"你交了 2 亿保证金买入了价值 20 亿的沪深 300 指数期货合约，接下来一个月，股市果然上涨，指数也在上涨，假设上涨了 8%，在这一个月中，你陆续买入股票建仓，假设建仓成本提升了 5%，那么额外成本就是 20亿 × 5% = 1亿，而你在期货市场的盈利是 20亿 × 8% = 1.6亿，不仅覆盖了踏空而增加的建仓成本，还有额外收益"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"638898f0-f9cf-4ad6-bd68-d36d25c92278","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"期货市场是一个高风险高收益的领域，作为投机者参与到期货市场具有相当高的风险，历史上有很多著名的期货事件："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"0e85c66a-0da7-41c8-97bf-ba330fc5f366","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a24e8679-9964-49d9-8ca6-9fb04b3563fb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"baea0ff5-1438-4fc7-8663-bdc6bb639ca1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"中国："},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SHkrBqED8","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"9fda0abd-d3c1-4cb5-8f2a-7b0ee9094660","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"327 国债期货事件"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"97ee008c-80f8-4924-9700-d2b383913584","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1995 年，当时中国通胀率很高，市场在赌财政部是否会给 327 这个国债品种进行保值贴补（否则利率都没有通胀率高，没人会买），当时有两个角色，以万国证券为首的空头（看跌）和以中经开为首的多头（看涨），万国证券的管金生认为不为贴补，大举做空，但是贴补的传言愈演愈烈，导致国债期货价格暴涨，使得万国证券损失惨重，达三年的利润，为挽回败局，管金生在最后 8 分钟利用漏洞卖出大量空单，将价格打回原形，输赢双方身份互换"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cab7cd80-81c9-4fe3-8560-6223805c34d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当晚，上交所宣布最后 8 分钟的交易无效，万国证券亏损数十亿，管金生入狱，此事直接导致中国国债期货被叫停了十几年"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4f766f29-4820-4b60-8b92-c83de86e9cfd","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b0dd7171-39eb-47d9-8744-e4e0da5e8cd2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"英国："},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kF411h7D9","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"46f652fd-95e3-4bb1-959b-35cbcce81de6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"巴林银行倒闭事件"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f9eaae67-7991-4c9c-a68b-0ff1630cee93","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"巴林银行拥有 233 年的历史，是英国最古老的银行，当时的一位交易员 Nick Lesson，在新加坡分部，对日经 255 股指进行了巨额的投资性交易以拟补亏损，但是当时日本发生了 7.3 级的神户大地震，导致日经指数暴跌，亏损瞬间失控，造成的亏损高达 14 亿美元，超过了巴林银行全部的资本金，使得这家百年老店瞬间宣告破产"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"70decc20-1dd4-4cfd-b77e-1585b7c8d703","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0a6bc7d9-9521-4abf-ace1-b75b140397bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"美国："},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rhpRzFEHx","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"ab04f671-f159-4f0a-a40f-5a668c193f5d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"亨特兄弟白银事件"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"33516014-6fc1-42ce-9456-d43d706420e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在上面我们看到了投机者由于贪婪引发的惨案，但投机者对于市场也是必不可少的："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"bc36713a-3aac-4f40-9be7-7a15ffe11fd3","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e4b60439-ef64-4dbf-a478-b608d654b223","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0fdb0c72-b3cb-47d5-ad48-52d5cd6b40c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"承担风险"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b0ceb802-9a54-49d2-87ee-393bd067068d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"套期保值者想要转移风险，那么就需要有人来承担风险，投机者就是承接方，它们承担风险是为了追求利润，风险就是它们利润的来源"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"34d3dd63-abf5-4488-b752-d08d9881cfa5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b0647d9a-1aad-4ea0-9aea-9eba965ccb8a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提供流动性"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1b304dc7-0dbd-4e70-9ccf-1390d0aefa22","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#6425d0","darkColor":"#a472fc","text":"所谓流动性就是想买的时候随时能买到，想卖的时候随时能卖出"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a2bb0e49-eee6-40ad-b847-5aa230ce01c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候套期保值者的买卖双方需求是不对等的，比如农民伯伯想卖 100 手，但是面包店老板却只想买 10 手。但是如果市场上存在成千上万的投机者，它们根据自己的判断进行买卖，比如其中一部分认为小麦价格会涨的投机者就会瓜分剩下的 90 手，使得农民伯伯可以顺利的完成套期保值，如果没有投机者，那么市场就是一潭死水"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cbad95b3-338b-4146-9864-9dc541e16325","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6838a52b-f30e-4c6e-8d1b-aaa115b15f60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"价格发现"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"99691c0d-4e1d-4769-b77b-e7f258aed217","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"期货市场的价格是怎么形成的，是无数投机者基于各种信息（如天气、政策、宏观经济等）的买卖博弈形成的。看涨的投机者买入，会抬高价格；看跌的投机者会卖出，会压低价格，这种买卖双方的较量最终会形成一个均衡的价格"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"37bf21e8-fd55-4b16-85d6-8d20b31c4325","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最后引用武林外传女赌神的一句台词，警以为戒："}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"cf84c741-fb10-46ba-8df8-27b1b2ddb71d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ff691c1-0277-4f58-aacc-2614d0846c51","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"赌就是赌，没有大小。因为，赢了的还想赢；输了的就想翻盘。一旦赌得兴起就什么都顾不上了。只要上了赌桌，不管赌术高低，身家大小。不玩到倾家荡产，谁也别想收手。所以，叫久赌必输啊！"}]}]}],"tags":["经济/期货","金融/衍生品","风险管理/套期保值","金融/投机","金融市场/功能","金融/历史事件"],"createTime":1762996156745,"updateTime":1790892401556,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1790892401556}}